  "description": "The LUNA 44 has been upgraded with more performance through increased front end and bottom bracket stiffness. The LUNA 44 is livelier and dynamic without compromising the durability and sleekness we have all come to expect. Whether you’re descending, climbing in or out of the saddle, or sprinting the new LUNA 44 excels with confidence. A superb choice that truly represents great value\n\nLuna leverages a purposeful blend of standard modulus 33 msi carbon fiber with some intermediate modulus 42 msi fiber to achieve our famous ride quality. These seamless, roll-wrapped tubes have been optimized to transfer power without transferring vibration through the pedals, saddle and handlebars. Luna frames are as laterally stiff as the Tetra and are nearly as comfortable. What the thicker walled carbon fiber tubes give up in absorption, they make up for in durability as they resist compressive and impact forces better than our Tetra and Dragonfly tube sets.\n\nOwing to this durability, Luna is ideal for off road and travel applications. The Luna Cross (CX) is one of the lightest, most durable and most versatile carbon cross frames on the market. Our CX model weighs three pounds in a 54cm and features top tube cable routing, a PressFit 30 carbon bottom bracket shell, titanium dropouts and mechanical or hydraulic disc brake compatibility.\n\nAvailable in Pro (road) and Adventure (endurance/gravel/cyclocross)\n\nOptional S and S Machine couplers\n\nOptional PressFit 30 carbon bottom bracket shell (Carbon wrapped bb only – not lugged)\n\nOptional rear axle spacing, tire clearance, brake type, cable routing and threaded eyelets\n\nFrame stiffness options\n\n10 Year Warranty\n\nMost affordable Calfee frame\n\nLeast expensive US made carbon frame\n\nMost durable tube set",
